From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 17:06:35 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] logging: report manual pruning height and selected file pairs
 as fields

Preserve the pruning diagnostic's Info severity, readable text, signed
effective height and signed pair count. The chainstate role retains its
existing ostream spelling through the same tinyformat %s conversion on
this infrequent path. No pruning range, locks, deletion or index changes.

Add a focused public FindFilesToPruneManual case using an independent
prune-enabled BlockManager with no eligible files. It checks zero selected
pairs, normal chainstate role, exact message and typed JSON without editing
private members or touching the fixture's block files. This checks the
no-selection path only; actual file deletion is not newly covered.

Shared eCash tier. Source-only event lint/diff checks pass; new native case
NOT_COMPILED/NOT_RUN. Sealed381/current integration remains unchanged.

